#: kcmkded.cpp:53
msgid "KDE Service Manager"
msgstr "KDE Xezmät İdäräse"

#: kcmkded.cpp:55
msgid "(c) 2002 Daniel Molkentin"
msgstr "(c) 2002 Daniel Molkentin"

#: kcmkded.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<h1>Service Manager</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to have an overview of all plugins of the KDE Daemon, "
"also referred to as KDE Services. Generally, there are two types of service:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>Services invoked at startup</li>"
"<li>Services called on demand</li></ul>"
"<p>The latter are only listed for convenience. The startup services can be "
"started and stopped. In Administrator mode, you can also define whether "
"services should be loaded at startup.</p>"
"<p><b> Use this with care: some services are vital for KDE; do not deactivate "
"services if you do not know what you are doing.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Xezmät Citäkçese</h1>"
"<p>KDE'neñ bar xezmätlären bu modul aşa küzätep bula. Xezmätlärneñ ike töp töre "
"bar:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>Cibärelgändä yöklänä torğan xezmät</li>"
"<li>Kiräktä yöklänüçän xezmät</li></ul>"
"<p>Sistem yöklägändä yönklänä torğan xezmätlärne tuqtatıp ta, cibärep tä bula. "
"Alarnıñ qaysısıların yöklisen idäräçe bulıp kergän çaqta bilgeläp bula.</p>"
"<p><b> Bonı belän saq bulası: xezmätlärneñ qayberläre KDE öçen bik kiräk; "
"xezmät ni eşlägänen belmägän çaqta anı yökläwen sünderäse tügel.</b></p>"

#: kcmkded.cpp:67
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Eşläw"

#: kcmkded.cpp:68
msgid "Not running"
msgstr "Cibärelgän tügel"

#: kcmkded.cpp:72
msgid "Load-on-Demand Services"
msgstr "Soralğaç Yöklänüçe Xezmätlär"

#: kcmkded.cpp:73
msgid ""
"This is a list of available KDE services which will be started on demand. They "
"are only listed for convenience, as you cannot manipulate these services."
msgstr ""
"Kiräge çıqqanda cibärelä torğan KDE-xezmätlär. Bu tezmä ber beleşmä itep kenä "
"kiterelde, ul xezmätlär belän eş itep bulmí."

#: kcmkded.cpp:79 kcmkded.cpp:93
msgid "Service"
msgstr "Xezmät"

#: kcmkded.cpp:80 kcmkded.cpp:94
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Açıqlama"

#: kcmkded.cpp:81 kcmkded.cpp:95
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Xälät"

#: kcmkded.cpp:85
msgid "Startup Services"
msgstr "Başlaw Xezmätläre"

#: kcmkded.cpp:86
msgid ""
"This shows all KDE services that can be loaded on KDE startup. Checked services "
"will be invoked on next startup. Be careful with deactivation of unknown "
"services."
msgstr ""
"KDE cibärelgän çaqta beryulı yöklise xezmätlär tezmäse bu. Bonda bilgelängän "
"xezmätlär kiläse cibärelüdä yöklänäçäk. Tanış bulmağan xezmätlär sünderü belän "
"saq bulası."

#: kcmkded.cpp:92
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Qullan"

#: kcmkded.cpp:100
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Başla"

